EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}At night, all this rain looks pretty.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I don't mind it nearly as much,
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

{{TAG:0003:0025:}}How are you coping with this rain?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
It's not nearly as bad at night,
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Passeggiare a tarda notte sotto
la pioggia ha un che di... mistico.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Prenderò una bronchite,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
